    "solution": "Jump from the western lip to the first pod. Release Jump before cutting down so the low rebound stays below the thorned roof. Cross above the first patrol’s lower turn and dash right while that rebound is level. Cut the second pod with Jump held to loft. Near the apex, dash up-right beneath the second patrol as it starts down, reach the high shelf, and run out. There is no intermediate ground refill.",
